OL,3,GNEWSASuccessful amendment puts 5% GST
OL,4,Aon the table
OL,5,
OL,6,FA proposal to increase the rate of a
OL,7,Fgoods and services tax (GST) to 5% has
OL,8,Fbeen approved in principle by deputies
OL,9,Fbut it will need to be voted on again
OL,10,Fat the end of a tax reform debate.
OL,12,FThe scheme proposed by Forward Guernsey
OL,13,Fcould see tax breaks for low earners
OL,14,Fand an investigation into incentives to
OL,15,Fencourage young people to stay in the
OL,16,Fisland.
OL,18,FStates members voted 21 to 16 in favour
OL,19,Fof the party's amendment.
