OL,5,
OL,6,FDebate on Policy and Resources' (P&R)
OL,7,Freform package for a 3% GST, lower
OL,8,Fincome tax rates, social security
OL,9,Fcontribution allowances, the
OL,10,Freintroduction of motor tax, higher
OL,11,Ftaxes on companies, higher income tax
OL,12,Fallowances and government savings
OL,13,Fcontinues.
